{"pageid": 1337, "title": "Gabi Lopez", "revid": 2789, "categories": ["Characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)", "Children", "Deceased", "Humans", "Tribulation"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Gabriella Lopez</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/0b/GabiLopez.png/revision/latest?cb=20250118055303\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"GabiLopez\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/0b/GabiLopez.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250118055303\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/0b/GabiLopez.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250118055303 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/0b/GabiLopez.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250118055303 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"GabiLopez\" width=\"270\" height=\"276\" data-image-key=\"GabiLopez.png\" data-image-name=\"GabiLopez.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"born\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Born</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">c. 2009</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Deceased</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alias\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alias(es)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Gabi Lopez</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Poisoning by <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> and blood loss from the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Erica Duplicitype (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJpY2FfRHVwbGljaXR5cGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Erica Duplicitype</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC35&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC35-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li>Unnamed mother †</li><li>Unnamed younger sisters †</li><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Rosalita García (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9zYWxpdGFfR2FyYyVDMyVBRGE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Rosalita García</span> † <small>(grandmother)</small></li><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Fernanda Lopez (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmVybmFuZGFfTG9wZXo/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Fernanda Lopez</span> † <small>(aunt)</small></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Riqui\" title=\"Riqui\">Riqui</a> <small>(temporary guardian)</small></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_21\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 21\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #21</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #35</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">I don't <i>care</i> what you think. I am <i>Gabriella Lopez.</i> I am a motherfucking Hurricane Woman. I'm not gonna die some pointless fucking death.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Gabi Lopez , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #35</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br />\n<b>Gabriella \"Gabi\" Lopez</b> was a young preteen girl living in <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation, New Mexico</span> in 2021 during the <a href=\"/wiki/Duplicitype\" title=\"Duplicitype\">Duplicitype</a> attacks. Having accidentally summoned the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Erica Duplicitype (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJpY2FfRHVwbGljaXR5cGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Erica Duplicitype</span> via her own fears, Gabi witnessed it killing her entire family, before teaming up with <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Riqui\" title=\"Riqui\">Riqui</a> in order to kill it. While laying a trap for the Duplicitype, Gabi and Riqui were caught by <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a>, who poisoned Gabi in order to lure Erica closer to her. Seeing that Erica had her way of seeing the monster cut off, Gabi allowed herself to be bitten by the creature in order to finally kill it, dying of both the poison and blood loss as a result.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Gabi is a preteen latina girl with dark skin and blue eyes. She has very short hair, swept over one half of her head while the other half is shaved; her hair is also dyed a bright green and pink. The exception to her short hair is one long strand, which she keeps braided over her right ear. She usually wears jackets and jeans.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">Personality</span></h2>\n<p>Gabi was a very troubled child, who would often snap at adults and authority figures. She was very rebellious and argumentative, and usually would pick fights with her grandmother,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC21&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC21-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> who was more religious than she was and took offense to Gabi's cussing out of God<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC35&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC35-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and graffiti on portraits of Jesus.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC21&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC21-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> She often swears, usually telling people to \"fuck off,\" and acts confrontational with strangers. She did not have a good relationship with the family cat, and was often rude to Riqui, who would watch over her family. Riqui said that Gabi would hide her emotions via her anger and frustration,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC22&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC22-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> which turned out to be true as Gabi claimed to be unafraid of death<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC33&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC33-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> despite that not being true.\n</p><p>Despite her anger issues, Gabi loved her family dearly, and was devastated upon finding them dead. She also became protective of Erica, dying in order to stop the monster that was hunting her. As she died, she admitted she was afraid, but that she needed to see her family and apologize to her grandmother for what she'd said about God.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC35&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC35-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>Gabi had a fear of humanity<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOC&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOC-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> that manifested in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Erica Duplicitype (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJpY2FfRHVwbGljaXR5cGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Erica Duplicitype</span>, which began hunting and killing children around Tribulation. It is unknown what exactly caused this fear, but she had an absentee father, her family was described as \"insane\",<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC27&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC27-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and she would often accuse people around her of being pedophiles or otherwise acting sexually, suggesting she may have some trauma surrounding that.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC22&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC22-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> She sometimes derogatorally refers to Riqui<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC23&#95;7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC23-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and other women caring for her as \"gay.\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC35&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC35-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Issues #<a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_21\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 21\">21</a>–<a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\">35</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3a9615f545b74915875f2dde17e562ab\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg (1.01 MB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c7/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20230226173550\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg (1.01 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #22 cover by Werther Dell&#039;Edera.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\" cover by Werther Dell&#039;Edera.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg (1.01 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Issue #22 cover by Werther Dell&#39;Edera.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22 Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is